      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<h3>Set the ¼ / ½ Select Lever only when the device is off</h3><br>\r\n<h3>The ¼ scale mylar is oriented with 0 in the center of the sheet</h3>\r\n\r\n\t<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/122/quarter_vs_half1.jpg\">\r\n<h3>The ½ scale mylar is oriented with 0 in the left of the sheet</h3><br><hr class=\"style13_pink\">\r\n\t<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/122/quarter.jpg\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 9718,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "&#188; vs &#189;",
          "slug": "188-vs-189",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 6351,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<style type=\"text/css\">\r\n\ttable.tableizer-table {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 12px;\r\n\t\tborder: 1px solid #CCC;\r\n\t} \r\n\t.tableizer-table td {\r\n\t\tpadding: 12px;\r\n\t\tmargin: 6px;\r\n\t\tborder: 1px solid #CCC;\r\n\t}\r\n\t.tableizer-table th {\r\n\t\tbackground-color: #5E9DED; \r\n\t\tcolor: #FFF;\r\n\t\tfont-weight: bold;\r\n\t}\r\n</style>\r\nEvery knitting machine has a set number of needles available to knit.  This limits the width of the knitting we can produce.\r\n<h3>How many needles do you have on your machine?</h3>\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"btn-group\">\r\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-default dropdown-toggle\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\">\r\n      100 <span class=\"caret\"></span></button>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tableizer-table table table-striped table-bordered table-condensed table-hover dropdown-menu\" role=\"menu\">\r\n\r\n      <thead><tr class=\"tableizer-firstrow\"><th>Sts per Inch</th><th>4\" / 10cm</th><th>Max Inches</th><th>Max cm</th></tr></thead>\r\n <tr><td>3.5</td><td>14</td><td>29</td><td><em>73</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>16</td><td>25</td><td><em>64</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4.5</td><td>18</td><td>22</td><td><em>56</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>5</td><td>20</td><td>20</td><td><em>51</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>5.5</td><td>22</td><td>18</td><td><em>46</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>6</td><td>24</td><td>17</td><td><em>42</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>6.5</td><td>26</td><td>15</td><td><em>39</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>7</td><td>28</td><td>14</td><td><em>36</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>7.5</td><td>30</td><td>13</td><td><em>34</em></td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n    </div>\r\n<div class=\"btn-group\">\r\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-default dropdown-toggle\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\">\r\n      110 <span class=\"caret\"></span></button>\r\n<table class=\"tableizer-table table table-striped table-bordered table-condensed table-hover dropdown-menu\" role=\"menu\">\r\n<thead><tr class=\"tableizer-firstrow\"><th>Sts per Inch</th><th>4\" / 10cm</th><th>Max Inches</th><th>Max cm</th></tr></thead>\r\n <tr><td>3.5</td><td>14</td><td>31</td><td>80</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>16</td><td>28</td><td><em>70</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4.5</td><td>18</td><td>24</td><td><em>62</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>5</td><td>20</td><td>22</td><td>v56</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>5.5</td><td>22</td><td>20</td><td><em>51</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>6</td><td>24</td><td>18</td><td><em>47</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>6.5</td><td>26</td><td>17</td><td><em>43</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>7</td><td>28</td><td>16</td><td><em>40</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>7.5</td><td>30</td><td>15</td><td><em>37</em></td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n    </div>\r\n<div class=\"btn-group\">\r\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-default dropdown-toggle\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\">\r\n      150 <span class=\"caret\"></span></button>\r\n<table class=\"tableizer-table table table-striped table-bordered table-condensed table-hover dropdown-menu\" role=\"menu\">\r\n<thead><tr class=\"tableizer-firstrow\"><th>Sts per Inch</th><th>4\" / 10cm</th><th>Max Inches</th><th>Max cm</th></tr></thead>\r\n <tr><td>3.5</td><td>14</td><td>43</td><td><em>109</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>16</td><td>38</td><td><em>95</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4.5</td><td>18</td><td>33</td><td><em>85</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>5</td><td>20</td><td>30</td><td><em>76</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>5.5</td><td>22</td><td>27</td><td><em>69</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>6</td><td>24</td><td>25</td><td><em>64</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>6.5</td><td>26</td><td>23</td><td><em>59</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>7</td><td>28</td><td>21</td><td><em>54</em></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>7.5</td><td>30</td><td>20</td><td><em>51</em></td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n<div class=\"btn-group\">\r\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-default dropdown-toggle\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\">\r\n      200 <span class=\"