              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<style>\r\n    .container-border1 {\r\n        border: 2px solid #ccc;\r\n        border-radius: 15px 50px;\r\n        padding-top: 20px;\r\n        padding-right: 20px;\r\n        padding-bottom: 20px;\r\n        padding-left: 20px;\r\n        background-color: white;\r\n        max-width: 500px;\r\n\r\n    }\r\n\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <div class=\"container-border1\">\r\n            The goal:<br>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>Design a triangular scarf</li>\r\n                <li>Gauge: 16/24</li>\r\n                <li>16\" x 16\" (40cm x 40cm)</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n        <hr class=\"style13_pink\">\r\n        <div style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">\r\n<span class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-1 fa-xl\" style=\"color: #9E2065; vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\r\n<h4 style=\"display: inline; margin-left: 5px;\">Draw the scarf shape at ¼ scale.<a href=\"/downloads/scarf_exercise_download.pdf\"> <i class=\"fa-regular fa-download\"></i> download</a></h4><br>\r\n<a href=\"#hint1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\">Hint:</a>\r\n<div id=\"hint1\" class=\"collapse hidden-print\">\r\n    <em> Divide the finished size by 25% ( 16 * 25% = 4\")<br>Use the 1/4 mylar with 0 in the center</em>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-2 fa-xl\" style=\"color: #9E2065; vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\r\n<h4 style=\"display: inline; margin-left: 5px;\">Choose the correct Stitch Scale for the gauge 16/24</h4><br>\r\n<a href=\"#hint2\" data-toggle=\"collapse\">Hint:</a>\r\n<div id=\"hint2\" class=\"collapse hidden-print\">\r\n    <em> Use the \"Q4\" scale</em>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-3 fa-xl\" style=\"color: #9E2065; vertical-align: middle;\"></span>\r\n<h4 style=\"display: inline; margin-left: 5px;\">Set the ¼ | ½ switch to ¼</h4><br>\r\n        <a href=\"#hint3\" data-toggle=\"collapse\">Hint:</a>\r\n        <div id=\"hint3\" class=\"collapse hidden-print\">\r\n   